      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.output) }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "367f8ca0-bdc6-4daa-a6f7-b8426e685d79",
      "name": "Note: in",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 440,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## 1 Case in, rules (code)\nThe kit runner POSTs one case here: `{case_id, today, input, output_schema}`.\nFile texts are already in `input` (e.g. `input.email`, `input.message`).\n**Load rules** reads the owner's rules (`data/*.md`) with the kit tool `rules_get`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1afe133d-39b8-47eb-88c0-86f0e23dbe5e",
      "name": "Note: read",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        380,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 340,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## 2 Read message (AI step)\nOne model call: what it is about, who, which days.\nPrompt: node **Read message** > Chat Messages > **Message**.\nThe fields: sub-node **Message fields**."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3a69d243-3a83-4f0b-ae43-aed8a25760c7",
      "name": "Note: events",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 260,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## 3 Events (tool, no AI)\nA plain HTTP call to the kit tool `events_list` (`POST .../mcp/call/<tool>`) for those days.\nMore context (trains): copy the node, change the tool name and the body."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a010ef7c-df75-4efc-a29f-d10325b62881",
      "name": "Note: tasks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1020,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 340,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## 4 Find tasks (AI step)\n**The main prompt is here**: node **Find tasks** > Chat Messages > **Message** (the steps). Change one thing, Publish, run the eval again.\n**Result shape** forces the schema of the case (`output.schema.json`)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0100d640-98a7-4549-8099-5a0c9a8d3f1f",
      "name": "Note: out",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1380,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## 5 Result out\nAnswers the runner with the result JSON.\nAfter an edit: **Publish** (top right). The eval runs only the published version. Then `make n8n-export`."
      }
    }
